# 统一换行符为 LF（跨平台协作；检出时按平台自动转换，入库一律 LF）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 锁定文件不参与 diff / merge
package-lock.json -diff
pnpm-lock.yaml -diff
yarn.lock -diff

# 二进制资源（即便将来误加入也不做文本转换）
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
